
ECMWF OpenIFS - README
======================

The OpenIFS model and accompanying software & files is for use 
by universities and other research institutes. It is not 
for commercial or operational use.

Use of the model is not allowed without a valid license, provided 
free of charge by contacting:

    openifs-support@ecmwf.int

	
Getting started
---------------
For details about how to build and run OpenIFS 48r1 please 
refer to 

https://confluence.ecmwf.int/display/OIFS/OpenIFS+48r1+User+Guide


OpenIFS User Forums
-------------------
The OpenIFS User Forums are available to post support questions. 
These are monitored by the OpenIFS support team as well as members
of the OpenIFS user community.
See:
     https://confluence.ecmwf.int/display/OIFSUF/



Mailing list
------------
A mailing list for announcements about the OpenIFS project 
is available at:

     http://www.ecmwf.int/publications/maillist/d/info/openifs-announce


User Support
------------
ECMWF provides dedicated support for OpenIFS. The support
team can be contacted at:

     openifs-support@ecmwf.int

